  "body": "Comfortable as it stands yet brimming with potential, this is an exciting opportunity to renovate, refresh and reap the benefits.\r\n\r\nNestled at the end of a cul-de-sac, this brick and tile unit offers two bedrooms, a combined bathroom, and open-plan kitchen, dining and living spaces.\r\n\r\nOutside the generous fenced rear garden provides plenty of room for future landscaping, while the single garage adds secure parking and storage and the off-street parking accommodates your visitors.\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to Long Bay College, Long Bay Primary School, beautiful beaches, local cafes and everyday amenities securing you a lifestyle to be enjoyed.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are rare, clear instructions for this deceased estate - Sell!\r\nBring your vision and make the move!",
